onTooltip":"Delete fact","DeletePersonCancelButtonLabel":"No","DeletePersonConfirmationButtonLabel":"Yes","DeletePersonConfirmationPanelMessage":"Delete %1?","DeletePhotoConfirmationPanelMessage":"Delete selected photo?","DeletePhotosConfirmationPanelMessage":"Delete selected photos?","Descendants":"Descendants","Description":"Description","Divorced":"Divorced","EDitGhostPersonAppearsTwiceConfirmationPanelText":"The person you would like to edit appears twice in the tree. To prevent duplicate data entry, the tree will now reload with this person in the center. Make sure the data you want to add or edit does not already exist and then edit again.","EDitGhostPersonConfirmationPanelText":"The person you would like to edit appears %1 times in the tree. To prevent duplicate data entry, the tree will now reload with this person in the center. Make sure the data you want to add or edit does not already exist and then edit again.","Earth":"Earth","Edit":"Edit","EditFactButtonTooltip":"Edit fact","EditFactPanelTitle":"Edit Fact","EditIndividualOnCardLinkTooltip":"Edit this person","EditPersonPanelTitle":"Edit Person","EmailAddress":"Email address","ErrorBirthDateHappendBeforeDeathDate":"Birth date happened before death date","ErrorCouldNotLoadSubTree":"Error loading family tree<br>click &lt;u&gt;here&lt;\/u&gt; to try again","ErrorCouldNotParseDate":"Warning: Could not understand date: %1","ErrorEmptyTreeDiscovered":"This tree is empty.<br>You can start a new tree by clicking the button below.","ErrorInvalidDate":"Invalid date","ErrorLifeDurationTooLong":"This person lived more than 122 years.","ErrorLoadingFamilyTree":"Error loading family tree. Refresh browser and try again","ErrorLoadingSkin":"Error loading images","ErrorSelectMonth":"Please select a month or remove the day","Export":"Export","ExportButtonTooltip":"Export family tree to a GEDCOM file","Fact":"Fact","Facts":"Facts","FactsPanelTitle":"Facts (%1)","FactsPanelTitleZeroFacts":"Facts","Family":"Family","Father":"Father","Female":"Female","FemaleMaidenMarriedDisplayName":"%1 (%2)","FemaleMarriedMaidenDisplayName":"%1 (born %2)","Find":"Find","First":"First","FirstName":"First name","FormatDateYear":"%y%","FormatDateYearMonth":"%m% %y%","FormatDateYearMonthDay":"%m% %d%, %y%","Gender":"Gender","GhostPersonAppearsTwiceIconTooltip":"This person appears twice in the tree","GhostPersonCancelButtonLabel":"Cancel","GhostPersonConfirmationButtonLabel":"OK","GhostPersonIconTooltip":"This person appears %1 times in the tree","HelpActionButtonTooltip":"Help","HelpTopicStep10Description":"Use this slider to determine whether to show distant family, or only the immediate family of the main person in the tree.<br>The main person is marked with a dark blue border.<br>To set someone as the main person, click the (+) button in the card and select View this person's branch.","HelpTopicStep10Title":"Relations slider","HelpTopicStep11Description":"Use the tools menu to:<br>View the tree in full size,<br>Print the tree,<br>Change display options.","HelpTopicStep11Title":"Tools","HelpTopicStep12Description":"Use this slider to zoom in or zoom out of the tree.<br>Zoom out to see the big picture, or zoom in to focus on the details.","HelpTopicStep12Title":"Zoom slider","HelpTopicStep1Description":"To add relatives to a person, click the round <b>(+)<\/b> button below the person's card.<br>To edit personal details, click the <b>Edit<\/b> link.<br>To add a photo, click the silhouette in the card.","HelpTopicStep1RODescription":"In the family tree chart, each person has a card in the chart with partners appearing next to each other and parents appearing above their children.<br>The cards are colored pink for girls and blue for boys. Each card shows the person's photo, name, date of birth and, if deceased, the date of death.","HelpTopicStep1ROTitle":"Welcome to your family tree","HelpTopicStep1Title":"Welcome to your family tree","HelpTopicStep2Description":"Using this menu you can add a relative to the selected person. For example, to add a father click the Add Father button.<br>On the left, you can also <b>edit<\/b> or <b>delete<\/b> the selected person, <b>add more photos<\/b> and take additional actions.","HelpTopicStep2Title":"Quick Action Menu","HelpTopicStep3Description":"Enter the <b>first name<\/b>, <b>last name<\/b> and <b>birth date<\/b> of this person.<br>It is recommended to enter the person's <b>email address<\/b> so that they will be invited to view and help complete the tree. If the person is deceased, remove the checkmark from <b>Alive<\/b> and enter the <b>death date<\/b>.","HelpTopicStep3Title":"Add person","HelpTopicStep4Description":"Click the <b>breadcrumb<\/b> arrows to navigate back to previously viewed people.","HelpTopicStep4Title":"Breadcrumbs","HelpTopicStep5Description":"Click the <b>arrows<\/b> in the compass to move around your tree.<br>You can also <b>click and drag<\/b> anywhere in the background to move around.<br>This reveals areas that are currently not displayed on the screen.","HelpTopicStep5Title":"Move around your tree","HelpTopicStep6Description":"Click the <b>leaves<\/b> above a person's card to view other branches of the tree.<br>This shows family members who are not currently visible in the tree.","HelpTopicStep6Title":"Open other branches","HelpTopicStep7Description":"Find a person by typing a name.<br>Click any person in the list to center the tree around this person.<br>The total number of people in the tree is shown below the list.","HelpTopicStep7Title":"List of people","HelpTopicStep8Description":"Click <b>Add Photo<\/b> to add more photos of this person.<br>To add additional facts like occupation and divorce, click the <b>Add<\/b> link next to the Facts section.<br>To edit an existing fact, check the <b>Select<\/b> checkbox and click <b>Edit<\/b>.","HelpTopicStep8RODescription":"This panel shows more details about the selected person","HelpTopicStep8Title":"Person page","HelpTopicStep9Description":"If you see this green icon, congratulations, MyHeritage has found Smart Matches for your tree!<br>A Smart Match connects a person in your family tree to people in family trees of other members.<br>Click the <b>green Smart Match icon<\/b> to see the matches.","HelpTopicStep9RODescription":"This panel shows more details about the selected person","HelpTopicStep9Title":"Smart Matches","HelpTopicsBalloonProgress":"Tip %1 of %2","Home":"Home","HomeBtnLabel":"Home","Image title":"Photo's title:","IndividualLookupControlText":"Find a person...","IndividualNameFormatMode0":"First Last (John Armstrong)","IndividualNameFormatMode1":"First, Last (John, Armstrong)","IndividualNameFormatMode10":"LAST FIRST (ARMSTRONG JOHN)","IndividualNameFormatMode11":"LAST, FIRST (ARMSTRONG, JOHN)","IndividualNameFormatMode2":"First LAST (John ARMSTRONG)","IndividualNameFormatMode3":"First, LAST (John, ARMSTRONG)","IndividualNameFormatMode4":"FIRST LAST (JOHN ARMSTRONG)","IndividualNameFormatMode5":"FIRST, LAST (JOHN, ARMSTRONG)","IndividualNameFormatMode6":"Last First (Armstrong John)","IndividualNameFormatMode7":"Last, First (Armstrong, John)","IndividualNameFormatMode8":"LAST First (ARMSTRONG John)","IndividualNameFormatMode9":"LAST, First (ARMSTRONG, John)","InvitationFormCanEdit":"%1 can edit","InvitationFormIn":"in","InvitationFormInvite":"Invite %1","Invite":"Invite","IsAlive":"Alive","Last":"Last","LastName":"Last name","Letter":"Letter","ListTabTitle":"List","LoadingFamilyTree":"Loading Family Tree","LoadingMessage":"Loading...","LoadingSkin":"Loading Family Tree Design","LoadingSubTree":"Loading branch","Look":"Look","MaidenName":"Maiden name","Male":"Male","MaleMarriedMaidenDisplayName":"%1 (born %2)","Maps":"Maps","Married":"Married","MarriedSurname":"Married surname","Max":"Max.","Maximize":"Maximize","MaximizeButtonTooltip":"Maximize the display","Month":"Month","MoreInfoErrorMessage":"Error loading person details, please try again later","Moreinfo":"More Info","Mother":"Mother","NCHIButtonT